*.sln
*.sw?

# Claude Code: personal approval state and fetched skill content (reproducible
# from skills-lock.json via `npx skills add`). .mcp.json and skills-lock.json
# themselves are shared project config and stay tracked.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/skills/
.agents/

# Secrets. Kept last: `vercel env pull`/`vercel link` append their own bare
# `.env*` line to the end of this file on every run, which would shadow an
# earlier `!.env.example` negation. Keeping ours last means it always wins.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
